{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "只是從天而降！",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8a8f7c113319163a5db06d195e6c908ad14c4e8d36d67343e31f46dd5a267d3a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_11"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事！他們還......真有點本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒被凍著吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓區域內的空氣變熱阻絕她的寒流，也只有你能做到了。多虧了你，我們沒什麼損傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用冰的，你怎麼不用致死性法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......霜星她那個樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜星，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......幫我......遮一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大姊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走，阿米婭。路上可能還有其他的整合運動。有傷患嗎？我可以搭把手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想這樣就撤退？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我勸你一句。別再戰鬥了，白毛兔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再這麼強撐著用法術，你會死得很快。你的力量正在把你的活力榨乾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，你可以來羅德島。至少我們有辦法延續你的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼一副......憐憫他人的樣子？誰需要你們的憐憫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，我看起來像是在可憐你？你挺強的，我是看得起你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "憑什麼讓你們逃走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，快走，別看她了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有整合運動在外圍廢墟向我們移動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大姊，你現在站的那個位置！別用那個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可以放他們走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島會對龍門的同胞做什麼，誰也不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫差升高，結構，脆化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，咳......凍結！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起作用了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們埋設的源石改變了下層結構，地塊已經開始傾斜了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大姊，你那個位置太危險了，快抱住我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大姊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......煌，聽見沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是建築物的碎裂聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埋設源石，吸熱，溫差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斷裂的建築牆體，難道......霜星的法術，也可以這樣發揮作用嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這塊地塊在變形！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動還能做到這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不清，但......整片區域在下沉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走！去穩固的區域待著，這裡的地塊要沉陷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你腳下......開裂了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}！跳過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "跳什麼......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，別去！Dr.{@nickname}，先抓住那根電線杆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先救博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地面撕裂傾斜的速度太快了，我勾不到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......沒事的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "周圍的建築物承受不了自重，正在墜落！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隕星，接好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我帶阿米婭走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，你走，我來幫博士！相信我作為羅德島幹員的實力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，看來還是要流點血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我會用氣流和真空壓減緩你的墜落速度，撐開你身邊的建築，放心，它們壓不到你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要怕！千萬不要怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一會兒見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一會兒見。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼？霜星呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們的指揮官也掉下去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛我們別打了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的兔子，我們暫時休戰怎麼樣？其實我們一開始也不太想和你們打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是各位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅菲斯特告知大姊，說你殺了亞歷克斯，所以大姊非常擔憂你們接下來的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......亞歷克斯是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉。碎骨確實是被我殺害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者本來不該相互為敵的。很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼好道歉的？你們當時在交戰吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們停火吧。大熊，你怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？*烏薩斯粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大熊說他也沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得他不是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要不在交戰狀態，就沒理由再讓誰去殺誰了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你......會想要停戰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我們兩邊領袖都是兔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我腦海裡似乎有什麼東西崩潰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凍原的雪怪居然是這樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不應該冷血無情，冰塊一樣嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那是偏見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小兔子，聽我說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰鬥的勝負，你們究竟去哪，我們都不關心。我們更在乎大姊的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們也在關注隊友的安危，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。我們不是為了傷害誰才深入廢城的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，你們不是來搞什麼“整合運動感染者大獵殺”的，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肯定不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們倒......不太能否認這個事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是因為愛國者大爹說整合運動需要團結，我們這就把梅菲斯特和參與他行動的小隊全部幹掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也算整合運動大獵殺了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一起挖開這裡，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
